<title>UK: TABLE - Amvesco reports jump in Q1 profits.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Amvesco reports jump in Q1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 5.3		   vs  4.2</p>
<p> Shr (fully diluted)     4.7		   vs  3.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     29.7		   vs 15.3</p>
<p> Income		     84.8		   vs 55.0</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full company name is Amvesco Plc, created from the merger of Invesco Plc and U.S. group AIM Management Group, which was completed on February 28, 1997. AIM results included from March 1, 1997. The company said funds under management stood at $160 billion (99.4 billion stg) at March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
